{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o115","title":"议者以为当移就险，郑浑主广开降路、宣喻恩信，谓保险自守是示弱","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-0316f117d8b3c5a6505b","label":"正文","text":"议者以为当移就险，郑浑主广开降路、宣喻恩信，谓保险自守是示弱","evidence":["rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9"]},{"id":"rensu-a-b720ff94626a0065181f","label":"正文","text":"郑浑聚敛吏民治城郭为守御之备，发民逐贼，明赏罚、与要誓，所得十以七赏；百姓皆愿捕贼","evidence":["rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424"]},{"id":"rensu-a-4c79d07b081961af07a3","label":"正文","text":"贼失妻子者皆还求降，郑浑责其得他妇女然后还其妻子，转相寇盗、党与离散","evidence":["rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ddf9e31c51c429f4e118","label":"正文","text":"郑浑遣吏民有恩信者分布山谷告喻，出者相继，使诸县长吏各还本治安集","evidence":["rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888"]},{"id":"rensu-a-e2ac53389fff1eed3804","label":"正文","text":"梁兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城","evidence":["rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"主议者；组织守御逐贼者；责还妻子者；遣告者","evidence":["rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888"]},{"person":"wudi-p0287","role":"党众离散之寇首；聚鄜城者","evidence":["rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","source_order":[16,318,47],"order":3447}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0084","name":"郑浑","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0287","name":"梁兴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":245,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"又遣吏民有恩信者，分布山谷告喻。出者相继，乃使诸县长吏，各还本治以安集之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":208,"end":244,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"议者悉以为“当移就险”，浑曰：“兴等破散，窜在山阻。虽有随者，率胁从耳。今当广开降路，宣喻恩信；而保险自守，此示弱也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"乃聚敛吏民，治城郭，为守御之备。遂发民逐贼，明赏罚，与要誓；其所得获，十以七赏。百姓大悦，皆愿捕贼，多得妇女、财物","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":107,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"贼之失妻子者，皆还求降。浑责其得他妇女〖10〗，然后还其妻子；于是转相寇盗，党与离散","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
